                "end": 30,
                "start": 30
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Estrada, LabCorp never asked the trial judge or the Federal Circuit to declare this patent invalid under \u00a7101, which is an affirmative defense they had to plead in the answer and prove by clear and convincing evidence."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Estrada",
          "citations": [
            {
