              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 34,
                "start": 34
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Estrada, in the Morse case, claim 8, it had been known for many years that it was possible to transmit using the electromagnetic current but nobody knew how. This Court\u2019s ruling on page 107 says this was known by men of science everywhere."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Unidentified Party Representative",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "8e14f67b26df95ffae023b1fecb05ab43b124081fa170eb8a04cde39c86811f2",
