              "pages": {
                "end": 51,
                "start": 51
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Unidentified Party Representative, we are only asking that the Court give further guidance on this patent and to say that a patent that claims nothing more than a natural correlation preceded by the inherent and generic step of measuring the input for that correlation is invalid and the judgment that is based upon it should also be reversed."
